5,1,1,talk,Shion,,We need to decide the purpose of the break room logically. I suggest we look at the actual problems we're facing before suggesting a use.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It would be better to see some data first so we don't make a mistake.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! Let's find out how everyone uses the room right now! That'll be like a treasure hunt!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be here. Let us remember that the heart of a workspace is the connection between the people within it.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Let's be practical. We need to identify the hidden costs and the labor involved in any potential arrangement.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll check the ""The partition wall to the office"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks."" I want to see how the current mess and noise affect us.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I think I'll look at the ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and ""Quotes for the two fit-outs."" I want to see the costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know who goes in there! I'll check the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person"" and ""Final clear-out of the old fridge""!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall examine ""Unplanned talk since the refit"" and ""Where the last awkward conversation happened"" to understand our social bonds.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will investigate ""Facilities callouts on this floor"" and ""Round trip for a hot lunch"" to assess the time and maintenance burden.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
