55,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A is a disaster; it brings the smell and noise of a kitchen right next to my ear. I can't support it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option B solves the outside hire costs and provides a structured way to use the room. It seems the safest choice.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A sounds fun, but @Toshio is right about the cleaning! Option B has a calendar, so it's fair for everyone!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option B allows for the private, meaningful conversations we currently lack. It transforms a room into a bridge between us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is a maintenance nightmare. Option C is a waste of space. Option B is the only one that optimizes our hours.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Shion,,"Option C is tempting for the silence, but it doesn't solve the problem of where we actually conduct our business.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the cost of Option B, but it's still better than paying for outside rooms every month.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Rin,,I vote for Option B! It's the most fair and we can finally stop arguing about who gets the room first!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Servas,,I agree. A meeting space provides the dignity and privacy required for a healthy professional relationship. I vote B.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,The logic is sound. It eliminates external costs and minimizes the labor of upkeep. I vote B.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Shion,,"Since the rest of you are so keen on B, and it's better than a noisy kitchen, I'll concede. I vote B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I feel comfortable with that. If everyone agrees, I'll vote for Option B too.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! We all agree! No more fridge-cleaning fights!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Servas,,It is a wonderful consensus. May this room become a place of understanding.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
